{"seq":3,"slug":"locking-mechanisms","title":"锁机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/transactions-and-concurrency/locking-mechanisms","wordCount":567,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"锁机制\">锁机制</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>锁是数据库实现并发控制的基本手段，用于协调多个事务对同一数据的访问。锁的设计需要在<strong>数据一致性</strong>和<strong>并发性能</strong>之间取得平衡。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 锁分类&#10;        A[按粒度] --&gt; A1[行锁]&#10;        A --&gt; A2[表锁]&#10;        A --&gt; A3[页锁]&#10;        B[按模式] --&gt; B1[共享锁 S]&#10;        B --&gt; B2[排他锁 X]&#10;        C[按策略] --&gt; C1[乐观锁]&#10;        C --&gt; C2[悲观锁]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 锁分类\n        A[按粒度] --&gt; A1[行锁]\n        A --&gt; A2[表锁]\n        A --&gt; A3[页锁]\n        B[按模式] --&gt; B1[共享锁 S]\n        B --&gt; B2[排他锁 X]\n        C[按策略] --&gt; C1[乐观锁]\n        C --&gt; C2[悲观锁]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"锁的粒度\">锁的粒度</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>锁粒度</th>\n<th>并发度</th>\n<th>锁开销</th>\n<th>死锁概率</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>行锁</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n<td>OLTP 事务处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>页锁</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>部分存储引擎</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表锁</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>DDL、批量操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据库锁</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>备份、迁移</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"行锁\">行锁</h2><p>InnoDB 的行锁实际上是加在索引记录上的锁，包含多种类型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>锁类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>锁定范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Record Lock</td>\n<td>锁定单个索引记录</td>\n<td>精确一行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gap Lock</td>\n<td>锁定索引记录之间的间隙</td>\n<td>不含记录本身</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Next-Key Lock</td>\n<td>Record Lock + Gap Lock</td>\n<td>左开右闭区间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Insert Intention Lock</td>\n<td>插入意向锁，等待间隙锁释放</td>\n<td>待插入位置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- Record Lock：精确行锁&#10;SELECT * FROM accounts WHERE id = 1 FOR UPDATE;&#10;&#10;-- Gap Lock：间隙锁（REPEATABLE READ 下）&#10;-- 假设 id 有值 1, 5, 10&#10;SELECT * FROM accounts WHERE id BETWEEN 3 AND 7 FOR UPDATE;&#10;-- 锁定间隙 (1, 5) 和 (5, 10)，阻止在此范围内插入&#10;&#10;-- Next-Key Lock：InnoDB 默认行为&#10;-- 锁定记录 + 之前的间隙&#10;SELECT * FROM accounts WHERE id &gt; 5 FOR UPDATE;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- Record Lock：精确行锁</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FOR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- Gap Lock：间隙锁（REPEATABLE READ 下）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 假设 id 有值 1, 5, 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 7</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FOR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 锁定间隙 (1, 5) 和 (5, 10)，阻止在此范围内插入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- Next-Key Lock：InnoDB 默认行为</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 锁定记录 + 之前的间隙</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FOR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"行锁与索引的关系\">行锁与索引的关系</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 有索引：行级锁&#10;SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = 100 FOR UPDATE;&#10;&#10;-- 无索引：退化为表锁（全表扫描需锁定所有行）&#10;SELECT * FROM users WHERE name = &#39;alice&#39; FOR UPDATE;&#10;-- 如果 name 列无索引，InnoDB 会锁定所有扫描到的行\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 有索引：行级锁</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FOR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 无索引：退化为表锁（全表扫描需锁定所有行）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'alice'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FOR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 如果 name 列无索引，InnoDB 会锁定所有扫描到的行</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"表锁\">表锁</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 显式表锁&#10;LOCK TABLES orders READ;&#10;LOCK TABLES orders WRITE;&#10;UNLOCK TABLES;&#10;&#10;-- 意向锁（InnoDB 自动管理）&#10;-- IS（Intent Shared）：事务准备对某些行加共享锁&#10;-- IX（Intent Exclusive）：事务准备对某些行加排他锁\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 显式表锁</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">LOCK TABLES orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">READ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">LOCK TABLES orders WRITE;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UNLOCK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TABLES;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 意向锁（InnoDB 自动管理）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- IS（Intent Shared）：事务准备对某些行加共享锁</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- IX（Intent Exclusive）：事务准备对某些行加排他锁</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>锁兼容性</th>\n<th>IS</th>\n<th>IX</th>\n<th>S</th>\n<th>X</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>IS</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IX</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>X</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"死锁\">死锁</h2><p>当两个或多个事务互相等待对方释放锁时，形成死锁（Deadlock）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 死锁示例&#10;-- 事务 A                          -- 事务 B&#10;BEGIN;                             BEGIN;&#10;UPDATE accounts SET balance = 100&#10;    WHERE id = 1;                  UPDATE accounts SET balance = 200&#10;                                       WHERE id = 2;&#10;UPDATE accounts SET balance = 100&#10;    WHERE id = 2;                  UPDATE accounts SET balance = 200&#10;-- 等待事务 B 释放 id=2 的锁          WHERE id = 1;&#10;                                   -- 等待事务 A 释放 id=1 的锁&#10;-- 死锁！\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 死锁示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 事务 A                          -- 事务 B</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;                             </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;                  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 200</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                                       WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;                  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 200</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 等待事务 B 释放 id=2 的锁          WHERE id = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                                   -- 等待事务 A 释放 id=1 的锁</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 死锁！</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"死锁检测与处理\">死锁检测与处理</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>数据库实现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>等待图检测</td>\n<td>周期性检测事务等待图中的环</td>\n<td>InnoDB（默认）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超时机制</td>\n<td>锁等待超时后自动回滚</td>\n<td>所有数据库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>死锁预防</td>\n<td>按固定顺序获取锁</td>\n<td>应用层实现</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- MySQL：查看死锁信息&#10;SHOW ENGINE INNODB STATUS\\G&#10;&#10;-- MySQL：设置锁等待超时&#10;SET innodb_lock_wait_timeout = 10;&#10;&#10;-- PostgreSQL：查看锁等待&#10;SELECT pid, wait_event_type, wait_event, query&#10;FROM pg_stat_activity&#10;WHERE wait_event_type = &#39;Lock&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- MySQL：查看死锁信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">SHOW ENGINE INNODB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">STATUS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\\G</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- MySQL：设置锁等待超时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> innodb_lock_wait_timeout </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- PostgreSQL：查看锁等待</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pid, wait_event_type, wait_event, query</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pg_stat_activity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wait_event_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Lock'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"避免死锁的实践\">避免死锁的实践</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 实践1：按固定顺序访问表和行&#10;-- 总是先锁 id 小的，再锁 id 大的&#10;BEGIN;&#10;SELECT * FROM accounts WHERE id = 1 FOR UPDATE;&#10;SELECT * FROM accounts WHERE id = 2 FOR UPDATE;&#10;COMMIT;&#10;&#10;-- 实践2：缩小事务范围&#10;-- 不要在事务中做耗时操作（如网络请求）&#10;&#10;-- 实践3：使用合适的索引避免锁升级&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_status ON orders(status);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 实践1：按固定顺序访问表和行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 总是先锁 id 小的，再锁 id 大的</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FOR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accounts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FOR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">COMMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 实践2：缩小事务范围</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 不要在事务中做耗时操作（如网络请求）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 实践3：使用合适的索引避免锁升级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"乐观锁与悲观锁\">乐观锁与